{"id": "16-148-2-3", "zh": "因为见于圣典等处。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-148-4-13", "zh": "但在《声论》（Saddasattha）和《界读摘要》（Dhātupāṭhasaṅkhepa）里，这些词根只列在 cur 等类中。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-148-14-25", "zh": "他们还主张，‘sukhayati、dukkhayati’是非使役的纯主动词形。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-148-26-45", "zh": "但我们不接受他们这种说法，也不把这些词形当作纯主动形式，因为它们与圣典等相违；正因为这样，这些词根在本书中列入 bhū 等类。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-148-46-60", "zh": "在纯主动方面，我们的看法是：‘sukhati（感到快乐），所以是 sukhita（快乐的）；dukkhati（感到痛苦），所以是 dukkhita（痛苦的）’。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-149-2-16", "zh": "可是，先生，‘sukhati、dukkhati’这样的动词在佛语中不是见不到吗？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-149-17-25", "zh": "确实如此；但即使这样，由于应当按义注的方法来理解，也就算是见到了。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-149-26-44", "zh": "因为并不是所有词根的全部形式在教法中或世间里都能见到，有些能见到，有些见不到。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-149-45-49", "zh": "即使这样，按类推的方法仍然可以得到。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-149-50-69", "zh": "因为既然见到了‘kappayavho patissatā（你们要带着正念安排）’，那么‘caravho、bhuñjavho’等形式按类推也就算是见到了。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-150-2-5", "zh": "这里的类推方法是这样的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-150-6-35", "zh": "在《清净道论》等书中有这样的话：‘哪怕只走了一两由旬的路，风就会紊乱，肢体就会疼痛（dukkhanti）’，这里可以见到属于 bhū 类、不及物、表纯主动的动词‘dukkhanti’。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-150-36-43", "zh": "见到了这个形式，那么‘sukhati、sukhanti，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-150-44-47", "zh": "sukhasi、sukhatha，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-150-48-60", "zh": "sukhāmi、sukhāma’等，以及‘dukkhati、dukkhanti，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-150-61-97", "zh": "dukkhasi、dukkhatha’等，也就都算是见到了，因为可以采用由已见推及未见、同类而无过失的类推方法；所以应当采用‘sukhati，所以是 sukhita；dukkhati，所以是 dukkhita’这一 bhū 类的方法，而不是 cur 类的方法。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-150-98-109", "zh": "这里还有另一种词源解释：他生起了快乐，所以是 sukhita，意思是生起了快乐的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-150-110-115", "zh": "**dukkhito**（痛苦的）这里也是同样的方法。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-150-116-122", "zh": "或者说，以快乐而转起，所以是 sukhita。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-150-123-132", "zh": "‘dukkhito’这里也是同样的方法。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-150-133-138", "zh": "这种方法很难得，应当好好记在心里。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-151-2-4", "zh": "mokkha，义为解脱。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-151-5-7", "zh": "这个词根是不及物的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-151-8-9", "zh": "mokkhati（解脱）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-151-10-11", "zh": "mokkha（解脱）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-151-12-13", "zh": "pātimokkha（波罗提木叉）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-151-14-28", "zh": "在使役形中有‘mokkheti、mokkhayati、mokkhāpeti、mokkhāpayati’这些形式。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-151-29-42", "zh": "但有些人把它读作‘mokkha，义为使解脱’，归入 cur 类。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-151-43-55", "zh": "按照他们的看法，‘mokkheti、mokkhayati’就成了纯主动词形。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-151-56-61", "zh": "这些说法与圣典和义注都相违背。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-151-62-68", "zh": "也就是说，它们与‘他们从魔的系缚中解脱（mokkhanti），", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-151-69-73", "zh": "沙门啊，你逃脱不了我（mokkhasi），", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-151-74-85", "zh": "我们要举行大祭祀，这样就能从恶中解脱（mokkhāma）’这些圣典文句相违背。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-151-86-132", "zh": "也与义注中‘谁守护（pāti）、保护它，它就使这个人从恶趣等苦中解脱（mokkheti）、释放，所以叫波罗提木叉’这句话相违背；因此圣典中不说‘mokkhesi、mokkhema’，而说表纯主动的‘mokkhasi、mokkhāma’，而且是以离格（apādāna）为对象来说的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-151-133-149", "zh": "而义注中说的是表使役主动的‘mokkheti、moceti’，这也同样是以离格为对象来说的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-151-150-165", "zh": "这样就可以知道，这个词根在纯主动方面是不及物的，在使役主动方面是带一个宾语的，就像 muc、pac、chid 等词根一样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-151-166-170", "zh": "如果有人问：mokkha 这个词根属于两个类吗？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-151-171-187", "zh": "不是，应当这样理解：因为在许多附有义注的圣典段落中，都见不到‘mokkheti、mokkhayati’这样的纯主动形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-152-2-4", "zh": "kakkha，义为笑。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-152-5-6", "zh": "kakkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-153-2-8", "zh": "okha、rākha、lākha、dākha、dhākha，义为干枯和足够。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-153-9-10", "zh": "okhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-153-11-12", "zh": "rākhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-153-13-14", "zh": "lākhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-153-15-16", "zh": "dākhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-153-17-18", "zh": "dhākhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-154-2-5", "zh": "sākha，义为遍及。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-154-6-7", "zh": "sākhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-154-8-9", "zh": "sākhā（树枝）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-155-2-12", "zh": "ukha、nakha、makha、rakha、lakha、rakhi、lakhi、ikhi、rikhi，义为行走。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-155-13-14", "zh": "ukhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-15-16", "zh": "nakhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-17-18", "zh": "makhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-19-20", "zh": "rakhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-21-22", "zh": "lakhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-23-24", "zh": "raṅkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-25-26", "zh": "laṅkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-27-28", "zh": "iṅkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-155-29-30", "zh": "riṅkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-156-2-4", "zh": "rakkha，义为守护。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-156-5-6", "zh": "rakkhati（守护）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-156-7-22", "zh": "rakkhā（守护）、rakkhaṇa（守护）；提婆达多守护了戒，戒被提婆达多守护，提婆达多是戒的守护者。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-157-2-4", "zh": "akkha，义为显明和计数。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-157-5-10", "zh": "akkhati、akkhi（眼）、akkha（感官）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-158-2-4", "zh": "nikkha，义为亲吻。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-158-5-8", "zh": "nikkhati、nikkha（金币）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-159-2-4", "zh": "nakkha，义为行走。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-159-5-6", "zh": "nakkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-159-7-8", "zh": "nakkhatta（星宿）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-159-9-25", "zh": "这里，nakkhatta 的意思是：它不忽此忽彼地不规则运行，只沿着自己的轨道运行，守护（tāyati）这种行走（nakkhana），所以叫 nakkhatta。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-159-26-38", "zh": "古人则说：‘它们不坏灭（nakkharanti）、不消失，所以叫 nakkhatta’。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-159-39-52", "zh": "‘nakkhatta、joti、nirikkha、bha’，这些都是星宿的同义词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-160-2-4", "zh": "vekkha，义为观察。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-160-5-6", "zh": "vekkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-161-2-4", "zh": "makkha，义为聚合。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "16-161-5-6", "zh": "makkhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-162-2-4", "zh": "takkha，义为 tapana。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-162-5-7", "zh": "tapana 就是遮护的意思。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-162-8-9", "zh": "takkhati。", "confidence": 90}
